// A rough cast cylinder (#639; CylinderBorer/, README "Cylinder borer"): iron or steel, cast in a
// fired cylinder mold from Steelmaking Expanded's canal (600 units, six ingots), its bore cored
// rough. The cylinder borer bores it into seraphhorizons:cylinder-{metal}. The variant is the game's
// metal code, which the mold's drop fills in. Drawn as the casting is on the borer
// (shapes/item/cylinderborer/cylinderblank.json, generated by CylinderBorer/tools/make_shape.py),
// its outside in ppex's engine cylinder's texture of its metal. The server disables it with
// CylinderBorer off.
